{
  "_comment": "Example: three entries per layer. The full glossary is private (madgodinc/hark-glossary); build.rs uses this file when it is missing. Gaming speech a general translation model gets wrong, grouped by kind of game. The server merges every group of a language; groups exist so a game can later be chosen in the app. Layers per group, applied in this order: calls (a whole short phrase answered without the model), terms (hidden behind placeholders the model copies verbatim), pre (slang rewritten into plain language before translating), fixes (repairs on the answer). Verbs never go into terms: a placeholder cannot be conjugated. Keys are matched case-insensitively on whole words; the server reloads this file when it changes.",
